{"id":"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-operator.md","title":"Operator","display":"df-operator — Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-operator","aliases":["58-df-operator","Operator","Linear Operator"],"display":"df-operator — Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","[[58-df-linear-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-operator</span><span>Operator</span><span>Linear Operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-operator — Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9fa59a08139e4466\" href=\"?note=9fa59a08139e4466\" title=\"58-df-linear-operator\">58-df-linear-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (normed spaces over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq X\">\\(D\\subseteq X\\)</span> (linear subspace serving as the operator domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in Y^D\">\\(T\\in Y^D\\)</span> (operator candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb K}(D,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb K}(D,X)\\)</span> (linear-subspace predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,Y)\\)</span> (linear-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\)</span> (bounded-linear-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9fa59a08139e4466\" href=\"?note=9fa59a08139e4466\" title=\"58-df-linear-operator\">58-df-linear-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,X,Y)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundedOperator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundedOperator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb K}(D,X)\\land T\\in Y^D\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb K}(D,X)\\land T\\in Y^D\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}bounded} \\vdash \\operatorname{BoundedOperator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}bounded} \\vdash \\operatorname{BoundedOperator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An operator may have a proper linear domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq X\">\\(D\\subseteq X\\)</span>; this permits densely defined unbounded operators.</li>\n<li>A bounded operator in this atom has full domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and agrees with the bounded-linear notion in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9fa59a08139e4466\" href=\"?note=9fa59a08139e4466\" title=\"58-df-linear-operator\">58-df-linear-operator</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reed and Simon, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-operator","status":"resolved","id":"9fa59a08139e4466","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-operator","status":"resolved","id":"9fa59a08139e4466","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)$ (bounded-linear-operator predicate, see [[58-df-linear-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-operator","status":"resolved","id":"9fa59a08139e4466","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"A bounded operator in this atom has full domain $X$ and agrees with the bounded-linear notion in [[58-df-linear-operator]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in Y^D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb K}(D,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoundedOperator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb K}(D,X)\\land T\\in Y^D\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}bounded} \\vdash \\operatorname{BoundedOperator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)","display":true},{"tex":"D\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"86302d021525a15b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"340d68d16ad589e7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca5920196b4108bd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9f617d787fc167c2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb K}$ (operator predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-operator.md]])"},{"id":"e6b661f277e95d9f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce3435ba1413059b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-910","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-operator.md|58-df-operator]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["f